    "readOutboxRow.exchange": {
      "title": "ReadOutboxRowExchange",
      "description": "One readOutboxRow request with its outcome, as v1.3: an answer, or one of readOutboxRow's errors, v1.3's and unchanged. The answer a v1.6 call gives is readOutboxRow.v1dot6Response, businessSensitive always among its fields (README item 45); readOutboxRow.response, which takes the field as optional, also takes an answer of v1.3 to v1.5, so every v1.3 to v1.5 exchange is a v1.6 exchange. The two answer branches overlap, which anyOf allows: the first names what a v1.6 producer writes.",
